  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.25 “Personally evaluated” means that a dentist with an active license performs an oral exam on the patient once in a 12 month period.\n\nSource. #12427, eff 12-6-17; renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.22)",
